bw.skilldesc.sword=Two spinning cuts that hit everything around you.
bw.skilldesc.axe=Leap up and split the ground, launching nearby foes.
bw.skilldesc.longsword=A rising cut that launches the target, then a falling cut.
bw.skilldesc.greatsword=Two heavy revolutions and a crushing finisher.
bw.skilldesc.spear=Charge forward, skewering everything in a line.
bw.skilldesc.dagger=A blur of stabs ending in a deep thrust.
bw.skilldesc.saber=Dash through your foes; the cuts land a moment later.
bw.skilldesc.mace=Jump and crash down with a wide shockwave.
bw.skilldesc.fist=A single palm strike that sends the target flying.
