bw.ui.m.combo=§lCombo§r: %s hits (attack repeatedly)
bw.ui.m.dash=§lDash attack§r: attack while sprinting
bw.ui.m.air=§lAerial attack§r: attack while falling
bw.ui.m.skill=§lWeapon art§r (sneak + attack, gauge %s):
bw.ui.g1.t=§l§6Attacks§r
bw.ui.g1.b=Keep attacking to chain a combo. Each weapon class has its own chain, timing, reach and arc. Swings hit every enemy inside the arc, even if you miss the crosshair.
bw.ui.g2.t=§l§6Guard & Parry§r
bw.ui.g2.b=Hold sneak with a weapon to guard attacks from the front (costs stamina when hit). Start guarding just before the hit lands to parry: no damage, and the attacker is staggered.
bw.ui.g3.t=§l§6Dodge§r
bw.ui.g3.b=Double-tap sneak to roll in your movement direction (backstep when standing still). You are invulnerable for a moment.
bw.ui.g4.t=§l§6Weapon Arts§r
bw.ui.g4.b=Landing hits and parries fills the blue gauge. When it is full, sneak + attack to unleash the weapon's art.
bw.ui.g5.t=§l§6Stamina§r
bw.ui.g5.b=The yellow bar. Used by dodging and guarding; refills after a short rest. If it runs out while guarding, your guard breaks.
bw.ui.g6=§7Sneak + use the Codex to quickly toggle battle mode. Commands: /scriptevent bw:menu, /scriptevent bw:toggle
